ast type, which improves readability without over-engineering.\n\n## Refactoring Applied\n- Introduced `BASE_PREMIUMS` lookup map to remove the `if/else` item dispatch.\n- Extracted a single result construction, removing duplicated return expressions.\n- Added a `Scenario` type alias to name the expected input shape.\n- Renamed `typedScenario` → `quoteScenario` and `itemType` → `firstItemType` for clarity.\n\n## Tests\n```\n✓ src/claim-office.spec.ts  (35 tests | 32 skipped)\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\nTests  3 passed | 32 todo (35)\n```\n\nAll tests green."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","usage":{"input":201,"output":1723,"cacheRead":13760,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":748,"totalTokens":15684,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784919812221,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-a8567148-efbf-492f-b6b3-9281bc4e27bb","responseModel":"moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code"}],"stderr":"","usage":{"input":2196,"output":8137,"cacheRead":73856,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":0,"contextTokens":15684,"turns":7},"model":"requesty/tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","stopReason":"stop"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1784919819759},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good refactor. Let me verify.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.bash:42","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"pnpm test 2>&1 | head -20"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","usage":{"input":993,"output":34,"cacheRead":35392,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":8,"totalTokens":36419,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784919819760,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-64f090bf-851c-4767-bb19-f72d7f1deec4","responseModel":"moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.bash:42","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n> tdd-experiment-run@ test /h